MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Read product identity from the selected app build manifest, validate frontend
fields before writing them, and document path and fallback behavior.

Co-authored-by: René Dudfield <renedudfield@microsoft.com>
---
